kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "architecture-core"
purpose: "定义 Crystalith v2 前后端基础结构约束：Bun/Elysia feature routers、web workspace domains、依赖方向与 TS 工具链。只覆盖结构与边界，不覆盖业务语义。"
valid_scope[2]: apps/,packages/
requirements[7]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,"Backend follows feature-sliced layout","后端 MUST 使用 `apps/server/src/features/<feature>/router.ts` 作为该域的 HTTP 路由入口；跨域共享放在 `apps/server/src/shared/`、`rag/`、`ai/`、`db/`。"
  r2,"Dependency direction is one-way","`features` MUST NOT 依赖 web 应用层；`shared` MUST NOT 依赖 `features`。仅类型标注可在 `import type` / 等价边界中例外。"
  r3,Router aggregation is centralized,"所有后端路由 MUST 在 `apps/server/src/server.ts`（`createApp`）统一挂载，避免多入口隐式依赖链。"
  r4,"Frontend workspace is domain-sliced","前端工作区 MUST 按 `apps/web/src/features/workspace/domains/<domain>/` 组织，每个 domain MUST 有可独立装配的入口。"
  r5,Frontend app/shared boundaries stay thin,"`apps/web/src/app` 仅负责入口装配；跨 domain 复用 MUST 放到 `apps/web/src/shared` 或 `apps/web/src/features/workspace/shared`。"
  r6,Workspace state uses sliced Zustand stores,"复杂工作区状态 MUST 按 slice 组织并通过 selector 访问，避免全局重渲染与循环依赖。"
  r7,TypeScript toolchain version,"server/web/shared workspaces MUST 使用 `typescript` `^7` 作为 devDependency；tsconfig `moduleResolution` MUST 为 `bundler`。"
scenarios[7]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,"add-a-new-backend-feature","","开发者新增一个后端 feature","该 feature SHALL 以 `features/<feature>/router.ts` 作为路由入口"
  r2,"import-layering-is-enforced","","代码引入了跨层依赖（如 `shared` 导入 `features`）","系统 SHALL 视为违规并要求修正"
  r3,"register-a-new-route","","开发者增加一个新的 API 路由","路由 SHALL 在 `server.ts` 统一聚合注册"
  r4,"add-a-new-frontend-domain","","新增一个 UI domain","代码 SHALL 放置在 `features/workspace/domains/<domain>/`"
  r5,"place-cross-feature-ui-reuse","","需要跨 feature 复用组件或工具","复用代码 SHALL 放入 `src/shared` 或 `features/workspace/shared`"
  r6,"add-a-new-workspace-state-slice","","UI 需要新增一类复杂的工作区状态","状态 SHALL 以 slice 组织并通过 selector 访问"
  r7,"check-tsc-major","","检查各 workspace package.json 的 typescript","版本范围 SHALL 为 `^7`"
